		"2026/10/13 12:00:00: Parsing statement [Native-Transport-Requests-1] (source: 10.0.0.1, elapsed: 15)\n" +
		"2026/10/13 12:00:00.001: Request complete [shard 3] (source: 10.0.0.2, elapsed: 420)\n"
